OR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106361","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106361.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106361.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nViewport has always been confusing in how it handled size, size_override and stretch_override. Not only was it unclear what it did, it also didn't function as intended. \r\n\r\nThese changes remove size_2d_override and size_2d_override_stretch in favor of a more intuitive texture_resolution_override which can change the resolution of the backing texture without changing the size of the viewport.\r\n\r\nAlso introduced a property auto_adjust_resolution which will update the viewport resolution when the game window changes","closed_by":{"login":"awsker","id":604653,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNDY1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/604653?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker","html_url":"https://github.com/awsker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awsker/repos","events_url":"https: